    "description": {
      "value": "You tear open the ground then slam it shut. The target creature takes 2d6 bludgeoning damage with a Reflex save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The target takes half damage.\n- **Failure:** The target takes full damage, is flat-footed, and takes a \u201310-foot circumstance penalty to Speed.\n- **Critical Failure:** The target takes double damage and is flat-footed and immobilized. It can attempt to Escape against your spell DC. If it doesn't Escape, the target takes an additional 2d6 bludgeoning damage when the spell ends."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): Increase the initial damage and additional damage by 2d6."
    },
